  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adjuvant Global Health Technology Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund is focused on accelerating the development of medical innovations for historically overlooked public health challenges. Its goal is to save or improve millions of lives by bringing urgently needed drugs, vaccines, diagnostics, and medical devices to market. We invested in the fund alongside a coalition of conventional and catalytic investors, including traditional asset managers, multinational biopharmaceutical companies, and other development finance institutions, with the aim of investing in healthcare solutions for those who need it most.</narrative>
  </description>
